  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhancing the Agricultural Extension System in Angola: Digital Solutions through RNPA-SEGI</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The primary objective of this Technical Assistance is to provide an institutional and sustainable IT system for the registration of farmers and pastoralists and the provision of technical packages to facilitate their access to agricultural subsidies and other services within the Rural Extension System. The goal is to deploy and customize an instance of the Identification, Delivery, and Empowerment Application (IDEA), a modular digital ecosystem developed by FAO which encompasses modules that support secure beneficiary registration and identification, management of the information collected, the digital management of technical packages (including but not limited to electronic vouchers, cash transfers and services), monitoring of interventions, reporting and visualization.</narrative>
  </description>
